			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741410101,
					"content": "（书页上的内容依旧是由无法理解的图形、字母与古语，以及几何图形构成。但集中精神后，似乎能渐渐理解其中的内容了。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阅读"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410102,
					"content": "夏诺蒂拉好像不在呢，可能又到那个神秘的地方去了！要进行「冥想」吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410103,
					"content": "听了她上次说的话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410104,
					"content": "有点在意。我要去看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410105,
					"content": "唔…虽然有点不安，不过我们一起去吧！夏诺蒂拉真是让人担心呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410106,
					"content": "派蒙，你在外面等我就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410107,
					"content": "欸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410108,
					"content": "「揭示之书」的世界…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410109,
						741410110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410109,
					"content": "可能比想象中更危险。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410111,
					"content": "所以，我不希望你冒险。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410112,
					"content": "但是…但是，一直以来我们不是一起冒险的吗？我们在一起，就没有克服不了的困难、战胜不了的敌人才对…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410113,
					"content": "里面的危险可能不是战斗能解决的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410114,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410115,
					"content": "好吧！哼，你比我聪明多了，我相信你。那你可别抛下我喔！我会一直等你回来的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410110,
					"content": "可能有我们不知道的一面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410111
					]
				}
			]
		},
