					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410803,
					"content": "谁？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410804,
					"content": "…原来是你啊。我记得你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410805,
					"content": "你怎么会在这里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410806,
					"content": "被你抢先了。我也想问你这个问题呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410807,
					"content": "没什么，我只是觉得…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410808,
					"content": "#你是{NICKNAME}，对吧？你身边那个白色的小东西…叫什么名字来着？她怎么没和你一起？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410809,
						741410811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410809,
					"content": "派蒙在外面等我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410810,
					"content": "是叫这个名字吗？算了，没所谓了。你是好人，派蒙也是好人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410812,
					"content": "我来这里，是要找一个很重要的东西。你知道我要找的是什么吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410813,
					"content": "算了，就当我没问吧。你怎么会在这里？快点离开。这里很危险，以前有人来这里接受试炼，结果迷失了，脑子变成了浆糊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410814,
					"content": "我想起来了，我和你，我们曾经做过很厉害的事情。那是我的一生中唯一值得骄傲的事情…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410815,
					"content": "你是说…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410816,
						741410818
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410816,
					"content": "战胜纳齐森科鲁兹？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410817
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410817,
					"content": "大师他怎么了？你也是水仙十字结社的成员吗…还是说，你是吉约丹的人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410820,
					"content": "啊，金色的蝴蝶。像阳光一样耀眼的颜色。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410821,
					"content": "只要得到了那样的光，一切都会…一切都会…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410818,
					"content": "拯救莉诺尔？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410819,
					"content": "我想起来了。没错，我们带着莉诺尔逃出了海底的牢狱。孩子们不应该生活在那样的地方。她应该生活在阳光下、花丛中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410811,
					"content": "你还好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410812
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
